OL,3,GNEWSAFighting Hugh Jackman in The Death
OL,4,Aof Robin Hood was 'surreal', says Welsh
OL,5,Aactor
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Welsh actor says fighting Hollywood
OL,8,Fstar Hugh Jackman in The Death of Robin
OL,9,FHood was "surreal".
OL,11,FJade Croot, from Merthyr Tydfil, said
OL,12,Fshe would sit and have cups of tea with
OL,13,FJackman before he helped her through
OL,14,Fgruelling fight scenes filmed in sleet
OL,15,Fand freezing temperatures in Ireland.
OL,17,FThe new dark thriller is based on a
OL,18,F17th Century ballad of the outlaw,
OL,19,Fstarring Jackman as the reflective,
OL,20,Fbattle-weary titular character at the
OL,21,Fend of his life.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
