OL,3,GNEWSAFighting Hugh Jackman in The Death
OL,4,Aof Robin Hood was 'surreal', says Welsh
OL,5,Aactor
OL,6,
OL,7,FCroot plays the character Wainwright
OL,8,Fwho is "looking for revenge" in the
OL,9,Fperiod action film, which also stars
OL,10,FJodie Comer as Sister Brigid, a
OL,11,Fmysterious healer who runs an island
OL,12,Fpriory.
